{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"tv/17520","tmdb_id":17520,"title":"憨夫成龙","original_title":"戇夫成龍","overview":"事情缘起于傻仔丁常旺，旺本是豪门富商包庆丰九代单传的独子，旺母本是包老爷的妾侍，因原配夫人妒忌，诬捏旺母与家朴有染，包老爷盛怒之下，视有了身孕的旺母是怀有孽种，把旺母逐出家门，旺母流落异乡并诞下旺，两母子过了二十几年相依为命的艰苦生活。而包老爷二十多年来仍无子嗣，直至原配夫人患病去迦后，包老爷有感膝下无子承继家产，遂派亲侄包大业往寻旺两母子，知不寻获，包老爷宁愿临老续娶求子，也不会把家业传给亲侄。大业一直欲承继包老爷家产，如今希望幻灭，遂起歪心，在寻到旺两母子时，暗中加害之，旺母死，旺被打伤后脑滚下山崖。业以为旺已死，即找来一个身份卑贱的孤儿，顶包假冒包老爷之子，改名为包继宗。大业并编造故事，令继宗亦以为自己就是流落在外的包家少爷。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulJZvmEuQ0Or7ue8AaRSQCEMtiY.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OexkmKMdi0NbmClT6VBIdRJsnb.jpg","first_air_date":"2002-12-30","last_air_date":"2003-01-24","year":"2002","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":20,"number_of_seasons":1,"tmdb_rating_average":5,"tmdb_votes":3,"tmdb_rating":"5 / 10 from 3 users","genres":["喜剧"],"languages":["Cantonese"],"countries":["Hong Kong"],"production_companies":["TVB"],"directors":[],"producers":[],"cast":[{"id":230576,"name":"郭晋安","original_name":"郭晉安","character":"Ting Seung Wong (Ah Wong)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/lmvdYkdC7i8RWF1pK0A4uMOv34k.jpg"},{"id":1223053,"name":"曹永廉","original_name":"曹永廉","character":"Bao Gai Chung","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/pU3V6I4xp4wIGRix7wibb5ga4wk.jpg"},{"id":102884,"name":"唐宁","original_name":"唐寧","character":"Ling Choi Dip","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/tQWWpHIWP9gW1uu2Zv4aErQiDYY.jpg"},{"id":230777,"name":"宣萱","original_name":"宣萱","character":"Ling Choi Fung","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/3hp9D2B1Y7L7imPUHCpHiNgxSY.jpg"},{"id":2338482,"name":"杨婉仪","original_name":"楊婉儀","character":"Yeung Pui Kwan","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/oyixHxQcDS8o8gTu7eNSu32iNI3.jpg"},{"id":63582,"name":"许绍雄","original_name":"許紹雄","character":"Ting Yau Lik","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/bgC8VLG8bBdbQTuiHQtjFlEXo6E.jpg"},{"id":139524